{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_ea1747f220c38a7b1d40dcab904d172564849d28a84870d08bc8f8ed61daa0d4", "title": "Oleg Menshikov", "text": "Oleg Evgenyevich Menshikov, (Russian: Оле́г Евге́ньевич Ме́ньшиков ; born 8 November 1960) is a Russian actor, theatre director and occasional singer. He is the current artistic director of the Yermolova Theatre in Moscow.", "score": 35.7393}, {"id": "hp_doc_eeb3e8ab4daac52c5d6751313f5abd5a8d7d642137b1d106c85bcb95d56476b3", "title": "The Pokrovsky Gate", "text": "The Pokrovsky Gate (Russian: Покровские ворота , \"Pokrovskiye Vorota \" ) is a 1982 Soviet comedy film produced for television by Mosfilm. It was directed by Mikhail Kozakov and stars Oleg Menshikov, Leonid Bronevoy, and Inna Ulyanova. The screenplay is based on a 1974 stage play by Leonid Zorin.", "score": 17.9062}, {"id": "hp_doc_475ddc9c45e6e247d12bc2a2e438512a82722b875b2c2787bc8df04814988c34", "title": "Prem (film director)", "text": "Kiran Kumar (born 22 October 1976), known by his screen name Prem called as \"Jogi Prem\" is an Indian film director and actor in Kannada cinema. He is also an occasional singer and lyricist. He is also Producer and runs his own banner called \" Preamdreamspictures\". He is considered one of the star directors in the Kannada film industry. He started his film carrier from Hello yama doing a small role. Making his debut as director in the 2003 released \"Kariya\", he directed back-to-back three successful films and is popularly addressed as \"Hatrick Director\". He made his acting debut in \"Preethi Yeke Bhoomi Melide\" in the year 2008.", "score": 8.6912}], "remaining_searches": 1}
